  ARRAY_CONSTRUCT($$Open on the KPI row: active Vehicles, movement utilization, empty miles percentage and average speed for the current region and date scope.$$, $$Call out empty miles percentage as the money metric - it is the share of distance driven with no load.$$, $$Click a row in the Vehicle list to select one and show the map recentering on it.$$, $$Read the detail panel for that Vehicle: current state, last ping and recent movement.$$, $$Ask the assistant on the left how many Vehicles are moving right now, and show it answering from the same numbers that are on screen.$$),
