Snowflake capabilities: Planned versus actual geometry compared in SQL with native GEOGRAPHY functions; Dedicated semantic view (SV_ROUTE_DEVIATION) so the agent can rank deviations directly; Deviation measured against the stored plan rather than re-simulated inside a BI tool.
