  $$Live drive-time market analysis for any site: who and what is actually reachable in 5, 10 and 15 minutes by road.$$,
  $$If we put a site here, how many people can reach it by road, and who is already competing for them?$$,
  ARRAY_CONSTRUCT($$Head of real estate$$, $$Network planner$$, $$Franchise development$$, $$Commercial strategy$$),
  ARRAY_CONSTRUCT($$Retail$$, $$Quick-service restaurants$$, $$Banking branch networks$$, $$Healthcare access$$, $$Public services$$),
  ARRAY_CONSTRUCT($$Click a candidate site in the list, or click anywhere on the map for a greenfield site.$$, $$Show the nested drive-time rings appear, and stress that they are computed on the click rather than looked up.$$, $$Read reachable population, households and median income for the band.$$, $$Open the competing venues table and count the competition inside the band.$$, $$Move to a second location and show every number change - that is the whole point of live routing.$$),
  ARRAY_CONSTRUCT($$Live isochrones from OpenRouteService running on Snowpark Container Services, called at click time and never precomputed$$, $$Third-party demographics and Overture places joined to routing output in one SQL statement$$, $$Drive-time catchment with no GIS desktop tool, no data extract and no per-seat licence$$),
  ARRAY_CONSTRUCT($$Candidate and existing site locations$$, $$A provisioned routing region covering the market$$, $$Optional: your own customer or loyalty data, which beats third-party demographics$$),
  ARRAY_CONSTRUCT($$Screen sites in minutes instead of commissioning a study per location$$, $$Compare candidates on a measured drive-time basis rather than on radius circles$$, $$Kill bad sites before spending survey money on them$$),
  $$Isochrones are computed at interaction time by calling OpenRouteService, never precomputed, so the region's routing service must be running. Population, households and median income are the real Census figures also used by Site Impact and Closure Impact: ZIP centroids inside the drive-time polygon, with income household-weighted.$$,
  $$Bands are cumulative (within X minutes), so never sum population or venues across band rows. The Census metrics are US-only and read 0 elsewhere, while the Overture venue and address counts populate in any region. Because the isochrones are live, a suspended region routing service means no rings.$$,
  $$catchment$$,
  ARRAY_CONSTRUCT($$reachable population and households$$, $$median income$$, $$venues in catchment$$, $$catchment area$$),
  ARRAY_CONSTRUCT($$How many people live within a 10-minute drive of this site?$$, $$How many restaurants compete inside the 15-minute catchment?$$, $$What is the median income of the 5-minute catchment?$$),
